        "text": "Thread 1/6 🧵\n\nThere’s a lot of buzz around Tesla’s new Roadster, and I must say, it was fascinating to watch a car jump over other vehicles and manoeuvre in mid-air.\n\nBut is it really as revolutionary as people are claiming? I have a few questions.",
